  "title": "Blueberry Nut Muffins",
  "description": "These blueberry muffins with nuts are made with milk, eggs, and oil for a tender, lightly sweetened treat that's great for breakfast or afternoon tea.",
  "authors": [
    "Valerie Ulloa Nickerson"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-06-18T23:42:20-04:00",
